[h2]Build 0.9.21[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]A belt piece that a Feeder had taken an item from (or a Loader had returned a leftover from, or that had its items dropped) could stop working: it no longer pulled items from a factory hopper beside it. Belts are now left in the right state, and belt pieces already stuck in a save start working again by themselves within a few seconds.
[/list]
